  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Acceleration of vehicle down the incline will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br />In the frame of the vehicle, we have to apply pseudo force. The Force diagram is shown in figure.<br />Component of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math>&nbsp;along the inclined (i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math>)&nbsp;will balance the pseudo force. Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Question25.png\" style=\"width: 248px; height: 181px;\" /><br /><br />Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>.</p></blockquote>",
